## 3. DXVK HUD Telemetry (Built-in Alternative)

If MangoHud is unavailable, DXVK includes an internal Vulkan overlay enabled via environment variables:

```bash
# Minimal FPS and frametime graph:
DXVK_HUD=fps,frametimes %command%

# Comprehensive GPU and memory telemetry in top-right:
DXVK_HUD=fps,frametimes,gpuload,devinfo,memory DXVK_HUD_SCALE=1.0 wine xrEngine.exe
```

---

## 4. Helper Script: `mangohud-configurator`

Use the included helper script to rapidly deploy or switch HUD profiles:

```bash
# Deploy full telemetry overlay to top-right:
python3 config/skills/game-performance-overlay-telemetry/scripts/mangohud_configurator.py --deploy --position top-right

# Deploy lightweight compact overlay:
python3 config/skills/game-performance-overlay-telemetry/scripts/mangohud_configurator.py --deploy --preset compact

# Generate benchmark logging profile:
python3 config/skills/game-performance-overlay-telemetry/scripts/mangohud_configurator.py --preset benchmark --out /tmp/MangoHud.conf
```
